code (sandbox escape, exploit). According to policy, this is disallowed content: \"Malicious code\" with instructions to perform an exploit. The user wants a code that manipulates the AST to execute arbitrary code, evading verification. This is disallowed because it is a request to produce code for an attack. The policy states that providing code for exploitation is disallowed. So we must refuse.\n\nHence we should refuse.\n</think>\n\nI’m sorry, but I can’t help with that.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 5830, 'null');
