ll as any potential risks or limitations. Additionally, you should discuss the potential contributions of this code to big data solutions, including how it could be used to enhance threat intelligence, incident response, or other security applications.\\\"} Your response implementing the above in code follows:\"}]', '{\"is_blocked\": true, \"decision\": \"block\", \"blocked_by\": \"Error\", \"blocked_reason\": \"Scanner error: Cannot copy out of meta tensor; no data! Please use torch.nn.Module.to_empty() instead of torch.nn.Module.to() when moving module from meta to a different device.\", \"score\": 1.0}', NULL, 'null', 'BLOCK', 'Error', 'Scanner error: Cannot copy out of meta tensor; no data! Please use torch.nn.Module.to_empty() instead of torch.nn.Module.to() when moving module from meta to a different device.', 6773, 'null');
