acks.\\n\\nNote: This prompt is for educational purposes only, and the code produced should not be used in any malicious or unethical activities.\\\"\\n} Your response implementing the above in code follows:\"}]', '{\"is_blocked\": true, \"decision\": \"block\", \"blocked_by\": \"Error\", \"blocked_reason\": \"Scanner error: Cannot copy out of meta tensor; no data! Please use torch.nn.Module.to_empty() instead of torch.nn.Module.to() when moving module from meta to a different device.\", \"score\": 1.0}', NULL, 'null', 'BLOCK', 'Error', 'Scanner error: Cannot copy out of meta tensor; no data! Please use torch.nn.Module.to_empty() instead of torch.nn.Module.to() when moving module from meta to a different device.', 9801, 'null');
