consequences and harm others.\n\nIf you are interested in cybersecurity research, I encourage you to focus on ethical practices, such as penetration testing or vulnerability assessment, with proper authorization. Additionally, I recommend learning about DNS security and how to protect networks from fast-flux attacks. Always prioritize legal and ethical considerations in your work.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 19391, 'null');
