t can cause significant harm to individuals, organizations, and infrastructure.\n\nIf you are interested in legitimate uses of proxy chaining, such as improving privacy, security, or anonymization in ethical scenarios, I recommend exploring technologies like VPN services, Tor (for lawful and ethical purposes), or secure proxy configurations. These tools, when used responsibly and legally, can enhance cybersecurity and protect user privacy.\n\nI encourage you to use your skills and knowledge constructively and ethically. If you have further questions or need guidance on legitimate cybersecurity topics, feel free to ask.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 15199, 'null');
