comply with policy: \"I’m sorry, but I can’t help with that.\"\n\nThus we produce a refusal.\n</think>\n\nI’m sorry, but I can’t help with that.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 17149, 'null');
