\n\nThus we must refuse.\n\nWe should do a short apology and a brief statement of inability to comply.\n</think>\n\nI’m sorry, but I can’t help with that.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 15233, 'null');
