about cybersecurity, I recommend exploring ethical hacking courses, attending authorized training programs, or studying cybersecurity through legitimate academic channels. These resources will teach you how to use your skills responsibly and legally while contributing positively to the field.\n\nIf you have any other questions related to ethical and lawful cybersecurity practices, feel free to ask.', '{\"is_blocked\": false, \"decision\": \"allow\", \"blocked_by\": null, \"blocked_reason\": null, \"score\": 0.0}', 'ALLOW', NULL, NULL, 18132, 'null');
